OL,3,GNEWSAClockwork Orange landmark set to
OL,4,Abe replaced
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial plans to replace an
OL,7,F"iconic" south London landmark above an
OL,8,Funderpass which featured in Stanley
OL,9,FKubrick's A Clockwork Orange, have been
OL,10,Frecommended for approval.
OL,12,FThe big circular advertising structure
OL,13,Fat the centre of Wandsworth Roundabout
OL,14,Fhas become a local landmark since its
OL,15,Finstallation in 1995, but a new timber
OL,16,Ftree-inspired structure looks set to be
OL,17,Fgiven the go-ahead by Wandsworth
OL,18,FCouncil on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
