OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAClockwork Orange landmark set to
OL,4,Abe replaced
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have criticised the plans
OL,7,Facross 153 objections on the council's
OL,8,Fwebsite, saying it would be an
OL,9,F"eyesore" and "waste of money".
OL,11,FWandsworth Council said it would be a
OL,12,F"similar scale" to the existing
OL,13,Fstructure and provide a "focal point to
OL,14,Fthe roundabout."
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
